{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Receiving","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Presenting","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iOS document provider ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, and a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSe