:" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An error from OID4VCgo: a stable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code"},{"type":"text","text":", the issuer’s, Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Server’s or Verifier’s own error code when it gave one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"type":"text","text":"), and a message for logs: it never carries personal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, a remote party’s own description, a URL’s path or query, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control characters. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sentence fit to show the holder; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isRetryable"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether trying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same step again may succeed."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":